  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n4 ÷ [2 + 2 ÷ {2 + 2 ÷ (2 + (2)/(3))}]\n\n**Concept Used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b4a976866809605733d20e8fb95249d5248894561586cf82e805abebf5c3df2f.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 4 ÷ [2 + 2 ÷ {2 + 2 ÷ (2 + (2)/(3))}]\n\n⇒ 4 ÷ [ 2 + 2 ÷ { 2 + 2 ÷ (8)/(3) }]\n\n⇒ 4 ÷ [ 2 + 2 ÷ { 2 + 2 × (3)/(8) }]\n\n⇒ 4 ÷ [ 2 + 2 ÷ { 2 + (6)/(8) }]\n\n⇒ 4 ÷ [ 2 + 2 ÷ (22)/(8) ]\n\n⇒ 4 ÷ [ 2 + (16)/(22) ]\n\n⇒ 4 ÷ (60)/(22)\n\n⇒ 4 × frac {22}{60} = (22)/(15)\n\n **Hence, the simplified value of the expression is (22)/(15)**",
